      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo make an Almond Caudle.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTake three pints of Ale, boyle it with Cloves and Mace, and sliced bread in it, then have ready beaten a pound of Almonds blanched, \u0026 strain them out with a pint of White wine, and thicken the Ale with it, sweeten it if you please, and be sure you skim the Ale well when it boyles\u003Cbr\u003E"
